exit: 1
error:
  code: saved_host_invalid
  message: the saved host file HOSTFILE does not hold one address in the form that `host save` writes; no host is read from it
help: Run `axeos-axi host forget` to remove the file; Run `axeos-axi host save <address>` to save a host again; --host <address> or AXEOS_HOST names the miner without the file
